{"articleNo":"307254","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=307254&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2021년도 국비유학(연수)생 모집 공고 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.04.19","hit":"8383","attachments":[{"name":"2021년도 국비유학생 (일반,꿈나래,기술기능인) 선발 시험 공고문 및 작성 서식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=307254&attachNo=99460"},{"name":"2021년도 기술기능인 국비연수생 선발시험 공고 및 작성 서식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=307254&attachNo=99461"},{"name":"2021년도 국비유학(연수) 선발 시험 공고 포스터.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=307254&attachNo=99462"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1. 국립국제교육원에서는 국가전략적 필요분야 인재양성을 위해 해외 석박사 학위과정 또는 단기 연수를 지원하는 장학사업을 추진하고 있습니다.</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">2. 이에 국비유학생 선발 파견 사업의 2021년도 선발 공고를 안내하오니, 관심 있는 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;가. 내용: 2021년도 국비유학(연수)생 선발 공고</span><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;나. 일정</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-left: 2em;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">온라인 사전설명회 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: ’21. 4. 22.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) 15:00 (</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">유튜브 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">「</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">국립국제교육원 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">NIIED</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">」</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">채널을 통한 생방송 송출예정)</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-left: 2em;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">응시원서 시스템 입력 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: ’21. 5. 17.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) 09:00 ~ 5. 28.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) 16:00</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-left: 2em;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">3)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">서류 등기우편 제출 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: ’21. 5. 28.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">소인 날인까지 접수</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-left: 2em;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">4) 1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">차 서류심사 예정일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: ‘21. 6. 19.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">토</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-left: 2em;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">5) 1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">차 서류전형 합격자 발표 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: ’21. 6. 28.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-left: 2em;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">6) 2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">차 면접시험 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: ’21. 7. 16.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-left: 2em;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">7)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">최종 합격자 발표 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: ’21. 7. 30.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-left: 2em;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">8)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">합격자 사전 교육 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: ’21. 8. 6.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-left: 2em;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">9)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">합격자 국비유학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">연수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">적응 연수 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: ’21. 12. 13.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) ~ 12.15.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"15004\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 0,\n\"dv\": 5,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.0\",